WEBVTT

00:30.010 --> 00:33.220
Today's concert is all sold out.

00:33.220 --> 00:34.970
Please be patient.

00:33.970 --> 00:36.090
Gates will open in ten minutes.

01:41.530 --> 01:43.120
Give me your report.

01:45.080 --> 01:47.290
I think it's a problem in the BDS.

01:47.670 --> 01:51.570
The Command Recognition Unit
apparently needs some improvement.

01:51.570 --> 01:54.090
So you're saying the abnormal
wave forms we found...

01:54.090 --> 01:56.680
...in the brain wave data
had nothing to do with you?

01:57.300 --> 01:59.930
I was in control at all times, sir.

02:01.760 --> 02:05.720
You're the only one who
really knows what happened.

02:06.270 --> 02:09.600
Because half of the
YF-21's control system...

02:10.060 --> 02:12.270
...is your own brain.

02:14.150 --> 02:18.280
Whether you did it on
purpose or by accident...

02:18.650 --> 02:19.450
Colonel!

02:19.660 --> 02:21.910
...people can't be
brought back to life.

02:25.410 --> 02:26.910
You're dismissed.

02:35.710 --> 02:38.590
It's me. Let me speak
with Doctor Worth.

02:42.720 --> 02:44.560
I need a confidential
inquiry performed.

02:45.430 --> 02:47.730
Subject: Guld Goa Bowman.

