The borderline

07:46.440 --> 07:51.610
Red and roses

07:52.530 --> 07:57.120
Lips and breath

07:58.580 --> 08:02.960
Hair and dolls

08:02.960 --> 08:06.010
They're look alike

08:10.470 --> 08:15.180
Smoke and mist

08:17.010 --> 08:22.140
Night and midnight

08:22.810 --> 08:27.520
The deep and hell

08:27.520 --> 08:30.370
They really get me

08:30.690 --> 08:32.740
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa...!

08:33.450 --> 08:34.660
Come to me, Sharon...

08:35.240 --> 08:40.830
Flip and fly

08:41.500 --> 08:47.130
Heal and feel

08:47.540 --> 08:52.850
Flower and poison

08:53.590 --> 08:59.100
Are on the brink

08:59.100 --> 09:02.890
The borderline

09:05.280 --> 09:08.700
The borderline

09:11.440 --> 09:16.030
The borderline

09:17.570 --> 09:21.620
The borderline

09:23.460 --> 09:27.000
Since we found nothing
wrong with the black box...

09:27.460 --> 09:31.170
...I believe the cause was a lapse
of your mental training, Myung-san.

09:31.920 --> 09:34.510
You really don't trust people as
much as machines, do you?

09:34.510 --> 09:36.510
No, it's just...

09:38.800 --> 09:45.060
If this keeps happening, we won't be able to keep
the fact that Sharon's AI is incomplete from leaking out.

09:45.060 --> 09:47.850
You're here to prevent that.

09:48.850 --> 09:50.860
Please be more careful from now on.

09:51.860 --> 09:52.820
I understand.

09:53.230 --> 09:55.280
Can we pick this up tomorrow? I'm tired.

09:55.820 --> 09:57.280
Tomorrow, then.

10:45.410 --> 10:47.450
You're gonna fly it properly, okay?!

10:51.960 --> 10:55.510
This isn't going to be like the simulator!

10:55.510 --> 10:56.340
Forget it.

10:57.260 --> 10:59.430
He's already up there.

11:01.590 --> 11:04.600
And we just got the 19 fixed...

11:23.700 --> 11:25.740
We finally meet...

11:27.080 --> 11:28.290
...pretty baby.

12:04.580 --> 12:08.660
Just 48 seconds to reach
atmospheric service ceiling...

12:09.330 --> 12:11.540
Oh baby, you're too much!

12:16.420 --> 12:18.260
Alpha One, do you read me?
Alpha One!

12:18.460 --> 12:21.220
What the hell are you doing?!
Stick to the test schedule!

12:26.350 --> 12:27.980
It's like he's out of control.

12:51.160 --> 12:53.460
What's that barbarian doing?!

12:55.670 --> 12:57.580
Look at chase camera three!

13:24.610 --> 13:26.160
Damned showoff!

14:57.540 --> 15:00.460
What do you mean
I'm overdoing things, sir?

15:05.500 --> 15:09.130
Never carry daring and
recklessness in the same pocket.

15:10.130 --> 15:11.640
You know who said that?

15:12.720 --> 15:13.550
No, sir.

15:13.550 --> 15:16.100
I did. And I learned that lesson the hard way.

15:18.020 --> 15:21.650
Do you know what else
you have in your pocket?

15:21.650 --> 15:22.480
No, sir.

15:24.730 --> 15:25.400
Stupidity!

15:37.240 --> 15:38.950
He's so transparent...

16:07.360 --> 16:11.610
This is the final poker chip
to install in the RF module.

16:13.570 --> 16:15.030
A literal entelechy, wouldn't you say?

16:16.080 --> 16:19.580
I don't acknowledge Aristotle.

16:20.200 --> 16:24.830
Or his belief that the mind
must be tied to the flesh.

16:28.090 --> 16:30.340
I could hardly believe it, Myung.

16:30.340 --> 16:34.510
Seeing you on TV introduced
as Sharon Apple's manager.

16:34.510 --> 16:36.100
Her producer.

16:38.140 --> 16:39.520
Well, whatever.

16:41.060 --> 16:42.980
You haven't changed at all, Kate.

16:43.940 --> 16:45.820
Except now I'm a mother with two kids.

16:45.980 --> 16:47.520
You're married?

16:51.240 --> 16:52.490
Who do you think to?

16:53.450 --> 16:57.150
Isamu, Guld, or Morgan?
Which one did I get?

16:57.660 --> 16:58.740
Morgan.

16:58.740 --> 17:00.240
Damn... That wasn't very fun.

17:00.870 --> 17:04.040
I ran into the other two.
Just by accident.

17:05.080 --> 17:07.170
They haven't changed a bit.

17:08.290 --> 17:11.510
They told me they're both test
pilots out at New Edwards.

17:11.510 --> 17:15.590
Really... So, we all
got what we wanted most.

17:16.390 --> 17:17.640
Hey, long time no see!

17:17.830 --> 17:19.100
Morgan!

17:19.510 --> 17:21.600
Why didn't you ask my
mom to take care of them?

17:21.600 --> 17:26.980
Well, I went to her house,
but she's having a garage sale.

17:26.980 --> 17:29.520
I was afraid she'd end up
selling the kids off, too.

17:30.360 --> 17:32.230
Oh well, then...

17:33.610 --> 17:36.740
Stop it! They copy everything I do.

17:53.760 --> 17:56.180
We'll always protect you, Myung.

17:59.890 --> 18:01.390
Forever and ever.

18:03.350 --> 18:05.310
Wherever we are, we'll
always come to help you.

18:08.600 --> 18:11.770
<i>Kyun, kyun! Kyun, kyun!</i>

18:11.770 --> 18:18.700
My boyfriend is a pilot.

18:16.730 --> 18:17.820
All right!

18:19.660 --> 18:22.660
Okay, now it's your turn, Myung.

18:23.160 --> 18:26.540
All right, this is it!
The school festival idol!

18:27.540 --> 18:31.000
Come on, Myung.
Sing that old song of yours!

18:31.380 --> 18:33.800
That one "Voices" or whatever.

18:33.800 --> 18:35.010
Great!

18:35.010 --> 18:35.920
Stop it!

18:40.470 --> 18:43.390
I mean... I quit singing.

18:43.390 --> 18:44.720
I had to move on.

18:45.220 --> 18:47.480
I got tired of it.

18:47.980 --> 18:50.810
And I can't remember any of
my old songs, now.

18:51.520 --> 18:52.440
Sorry...

18:53.440 --> 18:56.280
Well, I guess I'll sing, then...

18:58.240 --> 18:59.240
Kate?

19:00.410 --> 19:01.450
Gotta shit.

19:11.790 --> 19:15.380
It's me! You're gonna let me in
anyway, so I'm coming in, okay?

19:21.430 --> 19:23.640
Wha... What the...

19:24.220 --> 19:27.350
"What the hell are you doing?" I believe.

19:28.390 --> 19:30.230
I'm kidnapping Sharon-san.

19:30.230 --> 19:34.020
However, I can't find the
most important part.

19:35.480 --> 19:39.030
Well, I suppose her virginity
would be kinda hard to get.

19:39.400 --> 19:41.860
Please don't assume I'm like you.

19:41.860 --> 19:45.330
I was talking about her emotion program.

19:45.330 --> 19:49.870
Oh, please. This thing might
have intelligence, but a heart?!

19:49.870 --> 19:50.580
A heart...

19:57.210 --> 19:58.920
Isamu? Are you in there?

19:59.340 --> 20:02.180
Not if that old shit Millard's looking for me!

20:02.180 --> 20:03.800
You've got a call from some woman.

20:03.800 --> 20:04.970
Well, that's different.

20:07.180 --> 20:10.360
Yeah, hello? Kate...?

20:10.360 --> 20:14.860
Oh yeah! Hey, how've you been?
How'd you know I'm here?

20:14.860 --> 20:17.570
Trying to revive some mad
high school crush on me?

20:18.110 --> 20:19.820
You're the same old idiot, I see.

20:19.820 --> 20:22.030
Still punching holes in the walls?

20:22.030 --> 20:24.410
And you've still got a tongue like a knife!

20:24.990 --> 20:27.740
Listen, I've been having a drink with Myung.

20:28.910 --> 20:31.710
It's strange. She won't sing.

20:32.500 --> 20:34.460
Said she gave it up.

20:34.460 --> 20:36.880
She'd sooner give up food than her singing!

20:36.880 --> 20:39.050
This is a girl who used to sing in her sleep!

20:41.300 --> 20:44.220
Being Sharon Apple's producer
just doesn't seem like her.

20:44.390 --> 20:45.890
Producer?

20:45.890 --> 20:48.180
You think there's a connection?

20:48.760 --> 20:51.560
With the time you three broke up?

20:51.560 --> 20:54.020
You were all such good friends...

20:54.400 --> 20:55.880
How should I know?

20:55.880 --> 20:59.240
I guess we just aren't kids anymore.

20:59.240 --> 21:02.360
Well, can't you come out
here for a little while?

21:02.360 --> 21:03.820
Just to cheer her up?

21:03.820 --> 21:05.450
You've gotta be kidding.

21:05.620 --> 21:07.410
Guld said he would come.

21:07.580 --> 21:11.870
Well then, you definitely won't need me.

21:12.250 --> 21:13.710
Guld's gonna end up getting her.

21:15.830 --> 21:17.540
I said I'm not coming, okay?!

21:19.500 --> 21:20.420
You selfish jerk!

21:23.970 --> 21:24.840
Myung!

21:28.050 --> 21:29.300
Myung, I'm sorry!

21:31.640 --> 21:33.980
I don't want to go back to the past.

21:36.650 --> 21:37.730
I can't go back.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.690
Great Fall Lodge, please.

21:48.530 --> 21:49.070
Hi.

21:49.830 --> 21:51.700
One step behind her.

22:32.160 --> 22:33.410
I hate them...

22:34.660 --> 22:36.750
I hate your songs.

22:38.040 --> 22:39.960
And I hate my songs just as much...

22:43.670 --> 22:45.760
I don't want to see anyone else.

22:50.010 --> 22:51.850
I just want to go away and disappear...

23:14.370 --> 23:17.120
Hello. Hey, hello?

23:21.830 --> 23:26.300
A fire will break out at the
concert hall in 30 minutes.

23:26.470 --> 23:27.630
What...?

23:28.300 --> 23:33.140
A fire will break out at the
concert hall in 30 minutes.

23:33.760 --> 23:35.260
The concert hall?

23:35.640 --> 23:36.390
Myung!

23:38.390 --> 23:42.350
I get it. Something this
complicated is just Kate's style...

23:44.520 --> 23:45.360
Not!

23:49.110 --> 23:52.360
I'm afraid Myung Fang
Lone-sama isn't back, yet.

23:52.360 --> 23:53.660
I see...

23:54.990 --> 23:56.120
Room 405, please.

23:56.120 --> 23:57.160
Yes, sir.

23:57.160 --> 23:58.870
And put this in
my safe deposit box.

24:06.000 --> 24:10.470
A fire will break out at the
concert hall in 30 minutes.

24:10.470 --> 24:12.220
The concert hall...?

25:58.820 --> 26:00.950
Somebody! Somebody, help me!

26:03.580 --> 26:04.870
Somebody!

26:09.750 --> 26:10.590
Uh-oh!

26:11.380 --> 26:13.920
Don't mess with an expert reckless driver!

26:25.180 --> 26:26.200
Somebody...

26:26.200 --> 26:28.900
Myung! Are you in there?! Myung!

26:28.900 --> 26:31.980
Shit! Why isn't the alarm going off?!

27:34.210 --> 27:35.050
Hey, wait!

27:35.050 --> 27:35.880
Who the hell are you?!

27:35.880 --> 27:37.050
Someone involved!

27:39.010 --> 27:44.050
No, no one was hurt. Looks like
nobody was here when it happened.

27:44.050 --> 27:45.220
No one?

27:45.220 --> 27:48.430
No, but that still leaves a
lot of damage to this place.

27:49.180 --> 27:50.020
I see...

28:09.710 --> 28:10.710
Guld...

28:11.250 --> 28:12.710
Do you hurt anywhere?

28:14.080 --> 28:14.670
No.

28:15.540 --> 28:16.630
I see.

28:17.500 --> 28:19.470
Guld, you're hurt!

28:20.090 --> 28:21.340
It's nothing serious.

28:21.340 --> 28:22.430
Yes it is!

28:25.140 --> 28:26.220
Take off your shirt.

28:35.690 --> 28:37.480
What were you doing there?

28:37.480 --> 28:39.230
I got a strange phone call.

28:39.860 --> 28:40.570
Phone call?

28:41.200 --> 28:45.740
It said a fire would break
out at the concert hall.

28:45.740 --> 28:47.990
And besides that, I got it on my car phone.

28:49.410 --> 28:52.080
You mean someone planned it?

28:52.080 --> 28:55.960
What I don't understand
is why they warned me.

28:56.710 --> 28:59.550
I'm sorry. You got hurt all because of me.

29:00.550 --> 29:04.340
I don't mind, since I was able to save you.

29:09.770 --> 29:12.810
Thank you. You should get some rest, too.

29:15.810 --> 29:17.480
I'd better go.

29:25.910 --> 29:26.990
Forgive me...

29:28.950 --> 29:31.540
I thought I didn't want to see you.

29:31.540 --> 29:34.040
That I didn't want to go back to the past.

29:36.750 --> 29:38.380
I thought that I...!

30:04.110 --> 30:06.200
Well, it's nothing for me to worry about.

30:07.740 --> 30:11.740
Analysis of Bowman's brain record revealed...

30:11.740 --> 30:15.160
...a suspicious Beta endorphin secretion.

30:15.830 --> 30:22.640
Somehow, he's been suppressing the natural fighting instincts of his Zentraedi blood.

30:22.640 --> 30:25.010
When that instinct manifests itself...

30:30.430 --> 30:33.970
Don't tell this to anyone else.
Just continue your analysis.

30:44.940 --> 30:46.780
Where did you go last night?

30:47.320 --> 30:49.280
I didn't go anywhere.

30:49.280 --> 30:51.120
You blew out of here on your bike!

30:52.120 --> 30:53.620
I... don't know what you mean...

30:53.620 --> 30:55.410
It was that woman who
called you, wasn't it?

30:55.410 --> 30:56.710
No, it wasn't...

30:56.710 --> 30:57.330
Then why?!

30:59.040 --> 30:59.790
Uh...

31:05.590 --> 31:06.760
Are you listening to me?!

31:07.130 --> 31:08.010
Later!

31:08.010 --> 31:09.130
Isamu!

31:14.600 --> 31:17.850
So, a well-trained brain doesn't
protect you from getting hurt, huh?

31:17.850 --> 31:19.560
It's just a small burn.

31:20.520 --> 31:23.150
I gave my word once that
I'd always protect her.

31:23.520 --> 31:24.570
"Her?"

31:25.230 --> 31:27.110
Wait, the fire...?

31:27.440 --> 31:29.660
I won't let you lay one finger on her.

31:31.160 --> 31:35.660
But your ten fingers are okay?
Twenty, if we count your toes?

31:35.660 --> 31:37.290
Maybe you even got up
to number twenty-one...?

31:38.500 --> 31:40.050
Why you...!!!

31:42.290 --> 31:45.340
All that's left to fight over is the project.

31:47.050 --> 31:48.920
I can't wait.

31:59.230 --> 32:01.370
What the hell are you trying to do?!

32:01.370 --> 32:05.270
You're so god damned slow
I thought I'd get 'em for you!

32:07.070 --> 32:10.240
Alpha One and Omega One have
deviated from the test course.

32:10.780 --> 32:14.740
Altitude is 2000, 2300, 2600...

32:15.240 --> 32:17.540
Omega One to control.
Situation has changed.

32:17.540 --> 32:20.660
Will now conduct test of fighter's
battle-transformed combat ability.

32:20.660 --> 32:21.870
You're what?

32:21.870 --> 32:24.710
Control to Omega One.
Continue the test as scheduled.

32:24.710 --> 32:27.300
Alpha One! Correct course at once.

32:27.300 --> 32:30.380
This is Alpha One. Too much
static to make out your order.

32:30.380 --> 32:33.220
Disconnecting transmitter
until reception improves.

32:33.220 --> 32:35.260
Jesus... They're gonna fight!

32:35.260 --> 32:36.230
Idiots...!

32:36.390 --> 32:39.560
Alpha One and Omega One now
entering urban testing grounds.

32:43.650 --> 32:44.860
This is fun...

32:44.860 --> 32:46.570
Let's do it!

33:37.410 --> 33:39.410
It's turned into Pro Wrestling...

34:01.600 --> 34:03.100
Shit, gun's dry!

34:27.210 --> 34:28.170
You finished yet?!

34:28.630 --> 34:30.590
You second-rate piece of shit!

34:56.360 --> 34:58.880
I've got a bad feeling about those two...

34:58.880 --> 35:00.990
What's the point of not using live ammo...

35:00.990 --> 35:03.620
...if they're still going to wreck the planes?!

35:03.620 --> 35:04.870
What the hell is going on?!

35:54.590 --> 35:58.880
la vatda rah, ruena

35:54.590 --> 35:58.880
If in this world,

